{"id":"n57237-4-8","stage":4,"title":"맞히다 · 打中","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57237-4-8-1","ko":"총을 쏴서 인형을 맞히는 거죠?","zh":"就是用枪把玩偶打中的意思对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"총을","meaning":"枪","explanation":"총：枪；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"총","audio":"/audio/5a849f1fc9d520fe3fc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25521","senseId":"1","lemma":"총","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"총을","audio":"/audio/df8b35facd0f0e99aa1f.mp3"}},{"text":"쏴서","meaning":"射，打，发，放","explanation":"쏘다：射，打，发，放；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쏘다","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62596","senseId":"1","lemma":"쏘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏴서","audio":"/audio/e0844e849d11aabf3cc0.mp3"}},{"text":"인형을","meaning":"娃娃","explanation":"인형：娃娃；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인형","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70776","senseId":"1","lemma":"인형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인형을","audio":"/audio/1e8e760c259f88694a86.mp3"}},{"text":"맞히는","meaning":"打中","explanation":"맞히다：打中；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맞히다","audio":"/audio/552be2b11e026e3feb5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57237","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞히는","audio":"/audio/28fe99d35679d383e432.mp3"}},{"text":"거죠?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거죠","audio":"/audio/d739482dc8a726917f44.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5a849f1fc9d520fe","term":"총","zh":"枪","audio":"/audio/5a849f1fc9d520fe3fc6.mp3","entryId":"25521","definition":"利用火药气体压力抛射弹头的武器。","pronunciation":["총"]},{"id":"b4a8059171443b9b","term":"쏘다","zh":"射，打，发，放","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3","entryId":"62596","definition":"使某个物体用力飞到目标。","pronunciation":["쏘ː다"]},{"id":"0107283a24c66d34","term":"인형","zh":"娃娃","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3","entryId":"70776","definition":"做成人或动物模样的玩具。","pronunciation":["인형"]},{"id":"552be2b11e026e3f","term":"맞히다","zh":"打中","audio":"/audio/552be2b11e026e3feb5d.mp3","entryId":"57237","definition":"使某物命中目标。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/aac0eb1981f8051bc840.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57237-4-8-2","ko":"네, 맞힌 인형은 가져가시면 돼요.","zh":"是的，打中的玩偶可以拿走。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"맞힌","meaning":"打中","explanation":"맞히다：打中；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맞히다","audio":"/audio/552be2b11e026e3feb5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57237","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞힌","audio":"/audio/b2545ade3e26b7aa2375.mp3"}},{"text":"인형은","meaning":"娃娃","explanation":"인형：娃娃；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"인형","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70776","senseId":"1","lemma":"인형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인형은","audio":"/audio/d8713e75b6cea71e6a34.mp3"}},{"text":"가져가시면","meaning":"带走，拿走","explanation":"가져가다：带走，拿走；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가져가다","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53811","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져가시면","audio":"/audio/23de4f29a3cdf9c146ba.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"552be2b11e026e3f","term":"맞히다","zh":"打中","audio":"/audio/552be2b11e026e3feb5d.mp3","entryId":"57237","definition":"使某物命中目标。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"0107283a24c66d34","term":"인형","zh":"娃娃","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3","entryId":"70776","definition":"做成人或动物模样的玩具。","pronunciation":["인형"]},{"id":"d96cfec150bdc38f","term":"가져가다","zh":"带走，拿走","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3","entryId":"53811","definition":"把某个东西从一个地方搬去另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가저가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01be9f8a51c63857000e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.058,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57237","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.8847,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是用枪把玩偶打中的意思对吧？","是的，打中的玩偶可以拿走。","要喝咖啡吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就是用枪把玩偶打中的意思对吧？","是的，打中的玩偶可以拿走。","要喝咖啡吗？"],"answer":1}]}
